# Validation

## Framework semantics

Validation is the first ORM layer: stateless shape/type/format checks during `newEntity()` / `patchEntity()`.

## Required behavior

- Put format/presence/type constraints in validators.
- Do not treat validation as the only layer for uniqueness/stateful invariants.
- Prefer clear field-level messages for user-facing input.

## Anti-patterns

- Duplicate validation
- Enforcing persisted uniqueness solely through validation

## Review checklist

- [ ] Shape/format checks are validators
- [ ] Stateful checks also covered by application rules where needed